OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Facross all but the far west, with rain
OL,7,Ffor parts of Essex and Sussex. Low
OL,8,Fcloud spreads more widely across the
OL,9,Fregion overnight with patchy rain
OL,10,Fdeveloping. Mild overnight for most
OL,11,Fareas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FDamp and cloudy to start with
OL,14,Fpatchy light rain. Cloud likely to
OL,15,Fbreak by the afternoon with sunny
OL,16,Fspells and very warm temperatures
OL,17,Fpossible. Very mild overnight with
OL,18,Fstrengthening winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
